@startuml spectral_workflow_concept
title Spectracs — Spectral evaluation workflow: concept vs. implementation (recovered 2026-06-28)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

legend top right
  |= color |= status |
  |<#CDE7CE> | implemented |
  |<#FFF2CC> | partial / prototype only |
  |<#F8CECC> | missing |
endlegend

start
#CDE7CE:Acquire **REFERENCE** (isopropanol)\n~50 frames (burst);
note right: SpectrumSampleType.REFERENCE\nSpectralJob.spectraBySampleTypes
#CDE7CE:Acquire **SAMPLE** (isopropanol + pumpkin-oil drops)\n~50 frames (burst);
note right: SpectrumSampleType.SAMPLE
#FFF2CC:Reduce frames → one spectrum\n(**median** intended · **mean** today);
note right: SpectrumUtil.mean = numpy.mean\ngraph PLOT_SPECTRA_MEAN
#F8CECC:**ABSORPTION**   A(λ) = −log10( SAMPLE / REFERENCE );
note right: not implemented anywhere
#FFF2CC:**PROCESSING**   baseline · smooth · rebin · normalize;
note right: app: SpectrumUtil.removeBaseline (morphological), smooth (SavGol)\nprototype: Zhang baseline + spectres rebin (spectrasTest.py)
partition "**EVALUATION**  (intended: pluggable 'evaluation profile')" {
  #FFF2CC:**Spectrum → color → HUE**\nSD → XYZ (CIE 1931, D65) → xy → RGB → HLS;
  note right: WORKS in spectrasTest.py\n(colour-science + luxpy + colorsys)\nNOT integrated into the app
  #F8CECC:Judge HUE vs "perfect green"\n→ too brown / too green / perfect;
  note right: only a ΔE primitive exists\n(SpectralColorUtil.getColorDifference, CIE2000)
  #F8CECC:LDA classifier (Fisher);
  note right: abandoned — oil spectra lack\ndiscriminating peaks; never coded
}
#FFF2CC:Render + signal result to frontend;
note right: spectra render (pyqtgraph); no evaluation render
stop

@enduml
